# Exact, reviewed exceptions for scripts/check_flova_link_contract.sh.
#
# Format: repository-relative-path:line:rule-id
#
# An exception is only valid for code outside the Flova Link/configuration hot
# path (for example, a bounded local SoftAP form parser).  Do not use this
# file to exempt a codec, transport, configuration record, A/B storage, or
# reconnect-path allocation.  Every entry needs a nearby source-code comment
# explaining why it is outside that path and should be removed when possible.
